### Component 3: Model Architecture (`phase2.py`)

#### [MODIFY] [phase2.py](file:///Users/ashwinder./Desktop/pipeline/PIPELINE74ACC/bci/phase2.py)

**A. SubjectAdversarialHead**: Simplify from 2 hidden layers to 1 hidden layer
